{{!
    Catalogue filter chip — Phase B0 Catalogue iter 3 (2026-05-14)

    Used when an active filter is in place. Tap the chip to remove the filter.
    Designed to be iterated over for multi-filter setups.

    Context (single chip):
        href            (required) — URL that removes this filter
        label           (required) — visible text
        icon            (optional) — FA icon name (no fa- prefix)
        remove_label    (optional) — aria-label override, defaults to
                                     "Remove filter: {label}"

    Usage examples:
      Single inline:
        {{> local_airpay_catalog/partials/filter_chip }}
      List:
        {{#active_filters}}
        {{> local_airpay_catalog/partials/filter_chip }}
        {{/active_filters}}
}}
<a href="{{href}}"
   class="airpay-catalog__filter-chip airpay-catalog__filter-chip--active"
   aria-label="{{#remove_label}}{{remove_label}}{{/remove_label}}{{^remove_label}}Remove filter: {{label}}{{/remove_label}}">
    {{#icon}}<i class="fa fa-{{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{/icon}}{{label}}
    <i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</a>
